      527   field PostBox                like ub.person.post-box
      528   field BankNameRubl           as   character
      529   field BankCodeRubl           as   character
      530   field BankAccRubl            as   character
      531   field AddressBankRubl        as   character
      532   field AddressAddBankRubl     as   character
      533   field PBankAccRubl           as   character
      534   field BankNameBase           as   character
      535   field BankCodeBase           as   character
      536   field BankAccBase            as   character
      537   field AddressBankBase        as   character
