     2428         end.
     2429         if bf_tt-trn-doc.ExtDocType = 'vt':U              OR
     2430            bf_tt-trn-doc.extdoctype = 'vp':U         or
     2431            bf_tt-trn-doc.extdoctype = 'ap':U   or
     2432            bf_tt-trn-doc.extdoctype = 'mp':U or
     2433            bf_tt-trn-doc.extdoctype = 'pc':U   then do:
